      "article_id": "a1_3e7933363da4c4dccf8bd986",
      "headline": "Up to 30x More Work Per Watt: NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72 Sets a New Efficiency Standard for AI Agents",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "Consider what happens when an AI agent researches a company for an investment decision.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-25T08:04:02.718139+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c84f2a7ba67923cd784a3f22888639fbc1a9cc3eb65ed91e6fcbd0ba3052f09c",
          "excerpt": "Consider what happens when an AI agent researches a company for an investment decision.",
          "sentence_hash": "c154e256452b319074c78ec29e1c8dff5b86df3659d97bb3e927f5bc415e82cb",
          "anchors": [
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "Agents and sub-agents keep reasoning until the task is done, driving increased token demand.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-25T08:04:02.718163+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c84f2a7ba67923cd784a3f22888639fbc1a9cc3eb65ed91e6fcbd0ba3052f09c",
          "excerpt": "Agents and sub-agents keep reasoning until the task is done, driving increased token demand.",
          "sentence_hash": "44191bab7276ac9fba6086a6eac0dd65a5ac50960ea56cc097c5db6b24e0a01d",
          "anchors": [
            "agents"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "With every step, the accumulated tokens become the input to the next, making long-context handling central to agentic AI performance.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-25T08:04:02.718183+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c84f2a7ba67923cd784a3f22888639fbc1a9cc3eb65ed91e6fcbd0ba3052f09c",
          "excerpt": "With every step, the accumulated tokens become the input to the next, making long-context handling central to agentic AI performance.",
          "sentence_hash": "2b4bf8980f4b119c2491af4212acf1afadecffc6d69e431130dac9d814f554a7",
          "anchors": [
            "for",
            "performance"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "The same pattern plays out across every agentic use case, from software development to customer service to deep research.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-25T08:04:02.718201+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c84f2a7ba67923cd784a3f22888639fbc1a9cc3eb65ed91e6fcbd0ba3052f09c",
          "excerpt": "The same pattern plays out across every agentic use case, from software development to customer service to deep research.",
          "sentence_hash": "2bb8a98238a93ac7045715fe4b65cfbb9a99d1c8f0cba79e152635edbc0e2494",
          "anchors": [
            "deep"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "As agentic AI moves into production across industries, the infrastructure running it needs to meet that token demand efficiently.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-25T08:04:02.718218+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c84f2a7ba67923cd784a3f22888639fbc1a9cc3eb65ed91e6fcbd0ba3052f09c",
          "excerpt": "As agentic AI moves into production across industries, the infrastructure running it needs to meet that token demand efficiently.",
          "sentence_hash": "09a616ccf11b0202ad1adfe38d901e3ca556831774b97d7a3c83d6ce5b708786",
          "anchors": [
            "pro"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "New measured performance data shows NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72 systems deliver up to 30x higher throughput per megawatt than NVIDIA GB300 NVL72 on agentic workloads.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-25T08:04:02.718238+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c84f2a7ba67923cd784a3f22888639fbc1a9cc3eb65ed91e6fcbd0ba3052f09c",
          "excerpt": "New measured performance data shows NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72 systems deliver up to 30x higher throughput per megawatt than NVIDIA GB300 NVL72 on agentic workloads.",
          "sentence_hash": "f84b61e5ecc147a7beb869afdefc592b6f6289f4948bfd472e467ef7bb9d1443",
